/* ---------- Guest talk: the words written by hand ----------
   The phrases staff say to guests, the replies guests tap, and the allergy card, in the languages guests at Black Tap
   Soho speak most. Written by hand in everyday spoken style (not run through a translator), checked against Wikipedia
   and dictionary spellings, never checked by a native speaker on the team yet: App feedback for anything that sounds off.
   Any other language is translated live (lang.js), but never the allergy card's allergen names: those are only ever
   shown from this list, always with the English next to them.
   Sound-it-out lines ("say") are for English speakers: capitals are the loud bit. Non-Latin scripts get their usual
   romanisation (pinyin, romaji, Revised Romanisation) written the same way. */

